<section id="faq" class="py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <div class="section-kicker mb-4">FAQ</div>
        <h2 class="section-title text-balance text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl dark:text-white">Dúvidas frequentes sobre o SICAE.</h2>
        <p class="section-copy mt-5 text-base sm:text-lg">Tire suas principais dúvidas antes de começar.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-12 space-y-4">
        <div data-accordion-item data-open="true" class="accordion-item p-2">
          <button type="button" data-accordion-trigger class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-2xl px-5 py-5 text-left">
            <span class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white">O que é o SICAE?</span>
            <span class="accordion-icon inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/5 text-slate-500 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-slate-200">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" d="M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12"/></svg>
            </span>
          </button>
          <div data-accordion-panel class="accordion-panel px-5 pb-5">
            <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">SICAE é um sistema SaaS para gestão de cantinas escolares. Ele conecta a escola, os pais e os alunos, permitindo controle de vendas, estoque, cardápio digital e acompanhamento de gastos em tempo real.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div data-accordion-item class="accordion-item p-2">
          <button type="button" data-accordion-trigger class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-2xl px-5 py-5 text-left">
            <span class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white">Como funciona o portal dos pais?</span>
            <span class="accordion-icon inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/5 text-slate-500 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-slate-200">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" d="M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12"/></svg>
            </span>
          </button>
          <div data-accordion-panel class="accordion-panel px-5 pb-5">
            <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Os pais se cadastram, vinculam seus filhos e podem ver o cardápio, escolher quais produtos cada filho pode comprar, definir limites de gastos diários/mensais e acompanhar o histórico de consumo.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div data-accordion-item class="accordion-item p-2">
          <button type="button" data-accordion-trigger class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-2xl px-5 py-5 text-left">
            <span class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white">Quais formas de pagamento são aceitas?</span>
            <span class="accordion-icon inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/5 text-slate-500 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-slate-200">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" d="M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12"/></svg>
            </span>
          </button>
          <div data-accordion-panel class="accordion-panel px-5 pb-5">
            <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Pix, cartão de crédito/débito e faturamento mensal (lançado na mensalidade do aluno). Cada escola pode configurar quais métodos disponibilizar.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div data-accordion-item class="accordion-item p-2">
          <button type="button" data-accordion-trigger class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-2xl px-5 py-5 text-left">
            <span class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white">Preciso instalar algo na escola?</span>
            <span class="accordion-icon inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/5 text-slate-500 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-slate-200">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" d="M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12"/></svg>
            </span>
          </button>
          <div data-accordion-panel class="accordion-panel px-5 pb-5">
            <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Não. O SICAE é 100% web. Basta um navegador e internet. Funciona em computadores, tablets e celulares. Cada escola tem seu ambiente seguro e isolado.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
